WEBVTT

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:14.780
<i>In the year 2020 C.E.,</i>

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:18.240
<i>the human world is connected by a network.</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>Inhabiting it is
an unknown life form called Digimon.</i>

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:48.230
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:48.230
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:54.320
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:54.320
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.090
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.090
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:21.310
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:21.310
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:26.480
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:26.480
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.900
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.900
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:37.700
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:37.700
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.580
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.580
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:47.790
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:47.790
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:52.670
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:52.670
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:58.470
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:58.470
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:04.310
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:04.310
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.910
<i>To save Tokyo's crisis,</i>

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:15.440
<i>Taichi's party continues their journey
for the Holy Digimon in the Digital World.</i>

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:19.610
<i>As the children head for Cloud Continent
and reach the sea,</i>

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:23.910
<i>they meet new friends,
Joe Kido, and Gomamon.</i>

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:26.540
<i>Overwhelmed with studying for exams,</i>

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:31.380
<i>Joe barely shows any interest
in the Chosen Ones' mission.</i>

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.130
<i>Taichi's party are baffled,</i>

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:39.630
<i>but Gomamon diligently supports Joe
and continues to believe in him.</i>

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:43.720
<i>Joe is touched by Gomamon's actions</i>

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:47.600
<i>and decides to become real partners
with Gomamon.</i>

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:54.980
<i>In that moment, Joe's Digivice lights up
and Gomamon evolves into Ikkakumon.</i>

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.800
I see it! I see it now!

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:22.380
So the Holy Digimon is somewhere
on that continent!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.770
Joe, they said we're almost there.

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:33.190
We were able to get there straight
thanks to that light!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:34.520
Yeah...

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.900
Is it... a lighthouse?

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:39.860
In a place like this?

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:48.410
<i>Everyone,
I'd like to report Tokyo's situation.</i>

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:08.720
THE CHILDREN'S ATTACK ON THE FORTRESS

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:11.980
Due to the power failure,

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:17.230
the supermarkets and convenience stores
in the city barely have anything left.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:22.240
It hasn't even been a day
in our world, right?

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.200
It's already like that?

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:28.150
<i>Disasters have been recurring
since that last cyberattack,</i>

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:30.740
<i>so everyone's nervous.</i>

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.110
Koshiro-kun...

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:36.550
You're a fourth-grader?
You're quite smart...

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:37.380
<i>Huh?</i>

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.500
<i>Oh, not really...</i>

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:44.840
<i>As the oldest here,
I must be the one to lead everyone!</i>

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:48.640
<i>Anyhow, we'll hurry
and head over there too.</i>

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:54.230
<i>Everyone, please focus... Holy Digimon...</i>

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.150
Oh!

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.650
Koshiro?! Hey!

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.660
Oh! Hey, look...

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.720
W-What is that?!

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.710
Looks like a military facility!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:30.970
Watch out!

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:50.990
Hang on!

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:55.200
If I show my face,
we'll be targeted again...

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:56.750
Where's everyone else?!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.590
Palmon, are you okay?!

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:01.960
Somehow...

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.010
Mimi-chan!

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:21.690
We're saved...

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:24.150
Thank you, Birdramon!

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.700
All right, if we come this close...

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:35.790
Huh?

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:38.290
TANKMON

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:44.920
Get back!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:48.340
You guys!

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:51.430
SOLARMON

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:55.930
Here it comes!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.230
Meteor Wing!

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:05.320
Birdramon!

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:09.450
At this rate...

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:20.870
Taichi!

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.040
Petit Fire!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:36.430
This way!

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:57.410
What was all that?

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:00.790
Thanks a lot!

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:02.670
You really saved us!

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.460
Yamato!

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.210
I thought you'd be here too!

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:11.230
You know him?

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:13.880
Yeah, he's a friend!

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.970
That means, you're from before...

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:24.440
Yeah, I'm Gabumon.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:25.100
GABUMON

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:27.520
Gabumon! How you doing?

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:32.400
Yagami, do you know
Tokyo's situation right now?

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:35.570
Yeah, Koshiro told us.

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:40.240
In return, tell us...
about the situation here too.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:54.760
GORIMON

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:53.800
That's Gorimon.

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:59.810
Using Solarmon's light above,
Gorimon finds intruders and snipes them.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:05.440
Looks like they're protecting the fortress
with those Tankmon at the shore.

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:10.270
We're thinking of
sneaking into that fortress.

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:11.030
What?!

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:16.660
There are enemies out there
who are clearly targeting our lives.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:19.160
You guys know what I'm talking about.

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:23.370
Who in the world are they?

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:28.000
And are they connected somehow
to Tokyo's disasters?

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:33.420
If we can get in there, we should be able
to obtain some information on that.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.800
No way, we're just kids...

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:37.140
Let's do it!

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:40.720
Either way, we can't get anywhere
if we don't pass through!

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:41.640
Yeah!

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:42.560
Wait.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:46.230
Going in a group will only make us
their perfect target.

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:50.650
I don't need any dead weight.

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.820
Yagami, you watch those guys.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.190
Wait, Yamato!

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:57.110
Oh!

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.240
How nice of you, Yamato.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.460
You just want everyone to...

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.210
Let's go.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:11.710
Okay!

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.280
Gabumon Evolution!

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.800
Garurumon!

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:12.690
Taichi-san! You guys!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:18.660
It's no use,
our communication's being jammed.

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:21.780
Maybe something's happened
on Taichi-san's side...

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:24.290
We can't help that.

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:29.290
All we can do is believe in them
and just hurry as much as possible!

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:32.330
We're speeding up!

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:49.520
Tsk.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:55.820
It's too...

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:56.770
Huh?

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:58.900
It's too reckless after all!

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:01.490
Mimi-kun, I'm borrowing this!

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:02.400
What?!

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:05.200
Hey, that's my towel!

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:06.410
Hey, wait!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:14.840
Hey! We surrender!

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:17.920
We have no will to fight!

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:21.260
We only passed by here!

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:22.930
Wait a minute!

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:24.510
What is he doing?!

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:27.680
Don't use my towel as a white flag!

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:29.930
Joe! Come back!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:33.770
Don't worry!
If we just explain, they'll surely...

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:36.310
Joe!

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:56.130
Palmon, nice job!

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:58.420
My towel!

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:00.170
It's Sora's actually.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:05.540
Thanks, Joe Senpai.

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:07.510
I've made up my mind thanks to you.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:08.350
Huh?

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.720
Their perfect target...

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:12.980
That's what we'll become!

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:16.820
Agumon, we'll become a decoy
to back up Yamato and Garurumon!

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:17.870
Gotcha!

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:20.610
In that case... Piyomon!

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:21.540
Okay!

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:22.360
What?

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:26.360
Hey! What do we do?

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:27.360
Ah...

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.330
Wait...

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:41.880
Do we have to fight too?!

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:51.640
Things are quiet here.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.060
No!

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:57.100
Don't come this way!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:10.410
Jeez, they're fast as always!

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.290
He's impressive.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.000
Yeah!

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:40.810
DARKTYRANOMON

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.060
A gatekeeper!

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:44.610
Tsk!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.710
The odds are against us in power...

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:04.880
Baby Flame!

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:06.510
Magical Fire!

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:10.630
Yamato!

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.850
We'll hold this guy off!

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:16.600
You and Garurumon go ahead!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:21.230
Piyomon Evolution!

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:24.440
Birdramon!

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.620
You guys take Gorimon!

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:36.120
Hey!

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:40.250
It's Sora Takenouchi!
I leave that side to you guys!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.500
Let's go too!

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:56.270
Agumon!

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:57.510
Baby Flame!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.020
All right!

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:05.940
Agumon Evolution!

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:21.330
Greymon!

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:30.170
Now!

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:31.420
Jump!

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:54.840
Garurumon!

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:13.980
Fox Fire!

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:39.220
Palmon Evolution!

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:40.840
Togemon!

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:43.600
Gomamon Evolution!

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:46.640
Ikkakumon!

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:51.400
Prickly Bang-Bang!

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.610
Harpoon Vulcan!

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:13.040
Meteor Wing!

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:28.060
Now!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:33.060
Mega Flame!

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:11.310
Looks like there's no one left inside.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.230
There's some dirt on you.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:20.440
Thanks for saving us earlier!

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:21.700
No...

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:28.790
We're the one who were saved.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:32.250
I treated you guys like dead weight...

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:33.870
My bad.

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:38.840
Anyhow, I'm glad we're all alive!

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:43.720
Well, Joe is only alive thanks
to Palmon though!

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:45.550
H-How shameful...

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:52.350
Come quick, everybody!

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:03.400
What's this place?

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:12.750
There could be a record of their activity
or communication left here...

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:24.680
Isn't this...

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:52.710
This...

00:21:52.710 --> 00:21:53.540
Huh?

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.130
This is about the Holy Digimon!

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:07.380
<i>As if rolling out of control,
I ran frantically</i>

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:07.380
<i>korogaru youni gamushara ni hashitta</i>

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:11.260
<i>"What's waiting ahead?"</i>

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:11.260
<i>nani ga matteru no?</i>

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:17.770
<i>The headwinds told me</i>

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:17.770
<i>mukaikaze ga oshiete kuretanda</i>

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>"Just believe and move forward"</i>

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>shinjite susume</i>

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:24.490
<i>The bitter taste of defeat is a seed</i>

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:24.490
<i>yaburete shitta kuyashisa wa tane</i>

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:27.110
<i>It will eventually sprout
And become your wings</i>

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:27.110
<i>yagate mebuki hane to naru</i>

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:30.950
<i>I knock on those doors</i>

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:30.950
<i>sono tobira tataku riyuu</i>

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:36.790
<i>Because the present shapes the future</i>

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:36.790
<i>ima ga mirai wo tsukuru kara</i>

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:39.080
<i>If you want to find a rainbow</i>

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:39.080
<i>niji wo mitsuketai nara</i>

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:42.250
<i>You must lift your face</i>

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:42.250
<i>kao wo agenakuchatte</i>

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:47.510
<i>The hands that reached out to us
Make us much stronger</i>

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:47.510
<i>sashidasareta te ga
bokura wo zutto tsuyoku suru</i>

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:49.590
<i>If you want to catch your dreams</i>

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:49.590
<i>yume wo tsukamitai nara</i>

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:52.890
<i>Though the step forward is unsteady</i>

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:52.890
<i>furueru sono ippo mae ni</i>

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:55.640
<i>Try and take it</i>

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:55.640
<i>fumi dashite goran yo</i>

00:22:55.770 --> 00:23:00.650
<i>Because you can surely fly now</i>

00:22:55.770 --> 00:23:00.650
<i>ima nara kitto sora mo toberu kara</i>

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:04.730
<i>A one-on-one battle
between Orgemon and Greymon!</i>

00:23:04.730 --> 00:23:08.620
<i>That's when they're attacked
by the most powerful Digimon yet!</i>

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:12.450
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Ultimate Digimon Attacks"</i>

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:15.200
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
